  itemName: Reciprocal Bonecharm
  itemDesc: A fleshbound Kyrsan effigy of Ethironal worship. As their minds and focuses
    were robbed, their precise artisanry was twisted into a feverish production of
    foul convolutions of the organic. Peering into the beady eyes of the bonecharm,
    you see an early Ethironal shrine; unfinished, misshapen taxidermies lining the
    walls like an abattoir.
